    "sections": {
        "description": "Pixel Jewelry is a clean and structured website theme designed for showcasing jewelry collections, product catalogs, and brand information. The layout includes sections for featured products, image galleries, testimonials, pricing details, and contact information. It supports responsive design for different screen sizes and includes customizable typography, color settings, and homepage layouts. The theme is compatible with common eCommerce and page builder plugins, allowing users to organize collections, display product images, and manage online store functionality efficiently. It also supports blog sections for publishing updates, styling guides, or product-related content. Built-in navigation options and flexible widget areas help improve content organization across pages. Pixel Jewelry includes optimized code structure, social media integration, banner sections, and call-to-action blocks to support a functional browsing experience. The design focuses on visual presentation while maintaining readability and structured page layouts suitable for online catalogs and product-focused websites."
    },
